  (text "ANALOG FRONT END (one channel; AFE_B is an identical copy)\nInput +/-10 V, 1.003 Mohm || ~12 pF: scope-probe compatible (BNC). DC coupled.\nR101/R102 compensated divider = 0.0498 -> +/-0.498 V. Adjust C103 with a probe-cal square wave.\nU101 ADA4817 FET-input buffer on +/-4 V (low bias current into the 47k divider source).\nU102 THS4521 FDA: gain 953/499 = 1.91, VOCM = ADC VCM (1.5 V). +/-10 V -> +/-0.951 Vdiff (ADC FS +/-1 V, ~5% headroom).\nAnti-alias: Rf||Cf pole 7.6 MHz + output RC 7.3 MHz (2 x 49.9 ohm, 220 pF). Fs = 10 MSPS.\nD101 low-leakage clamps to the +/-4 V rails; fault current limited by R101 (953k)."
    (at 63.5 162.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e615196b-f9ed-4e47-a748-b736588f3645")
  )
